and 1,4-dioxane (3 mL) was treated with BrCN and the mixture was stirred
at 25°C for 1 h. After addition of NaHCO3 (150 mg), the mixture was
stirred for 19 h. The solid was filtered and washed with water to provide
the product 1919B (205 mg,85%).
